Package: peruspecies
Title: Reproducible Biodiversity Occurrence Queries for Peru
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Peru Species Project", family = "Maintainers", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "TODO@example.com")
Description: Downloads, spatially validates, normalizes, and exports GBIF and
    iNaturalist occurrence records for districts in Peru. Administrative
    boundaries are retrieved with geoperu and each run generates output
    artifacts and provenance metadata.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    geoperu,
    ggplot2,
    jsonlite,
    readr,
    rgbif,
    rinat,
    sf
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://paulesantos.github.io/peru_species_project/
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
